# Ignore everything in this directory (generated HTML, etc.)...
/*
# ...except these three pages
!/index.html
!/tractatus.html
!/start.html
# ...and the committed agent-skills tree (published by the website deploy)
!/skills
# ...but the rendered skill HTML is derived from the .md — regenerated, not committed
# skills/**/*.html
# ...and the article figures: each is a committed .tex sidecar (the tikz-cd source,
# read back by articles/tikz.lua for the PDF) plus the .svg the markdown references.
# The rest of articles/ stays generated/ignored, so articles/ has to be re-included
# first — a negation inside an excluded directory is otherwise never consulted.
!/articles/
/articles/*
!/articles/images/
!/articles/images/**
